src/index.js follows the DWI procedure of MRtrix3 dwibiascorrect ants
(lib/mrtrix3/dwibiascorrect/ants.py, Copyright (c) 2008-2025 the MRtrix3
contributors, Mozilla Public License v. 2.0): N4 on the mean b0 with the
brain mask as weights, a global rescaling of the field to keep the brain
integral, and division of every volume by the field.

Tustison NJ, Avants BB, Cook PA, et al. (2010). N4ITK: improved N3 bias
correction. IEEE Trans Med Imaging 29(6):1310-1320.
